  designNotes: '2026-09-02, Meshy AI attack (雙重連擊.zip / Double_Combo_Attack, take
    "Scene", 2.83s) imported as Wushi_TwinStrike. Same source clip family as the retired
    Wushi_DoubleCombo, but measured properly this time: real RootT net forward travel
    is only 0.63m (the old "starts 3m behind, walks forward" note was the AnimationMode
    hip-drift artifact - not real). So it is an IN-PLACE two-hit down-combo. Blade
    crashes Y 5.2 -> 0.8 across nt 0.10-0.25 (speed peak 43) = hit 1 (window nt 0.18-0.32),
    rises again, crashes Y 6.1 -> 0.0 across nt 0.45-0.65 (speed 43) = hit 2 (window
    nt 0.52-0.68, damageMultiplier 1.15 - the committed second beat). Wired useRootMotion=1
    + rootMotionScale 1.4 (0.63m -> ~0.9m tiny forward commit), close-range pool
    (minDistance 0, maxDistance 3.6). deflectReaction ContinueCombo, knockback 0 per
    session rules. NEEDS PLAY TUNING: hit window nt, damage 22/25.3, the small step-in.'
